      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m guessing we\u0027re going to want something to specify workgroup_size, too. Metal is definitely the odd duck there - it seems to specify that via API, where all other backends do it in the shader (SPIR-V, HLSL, GLSL, WGSL). Most likely, we\u0027ll have to have something in the shader, then reflect it out, so that the Metal backend can get the info from the shader and use it to make the right API call. (It looks like this is what WGSL/Dawn do?)",
      "revId": "6823448d537e3a58f9e2c740f98ac73cb405f06d",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
